---
import { SITE } from '../data/site';
---
<div class="redes">
  <aside class="zap" aria-labelledby="zap-titulo">
    <div class="zap-icone" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
        <path d="M20.5 3.5A11 11 0 0 0 2.1 17.2L1 23l6-1.6A11 11 0 0 0 20.5 3.5zM12 20.2a9.1 9.1 0 0 1-4.6-1.3l-.3-.2-3.6.9.9-3.5-.2-.3A9.1 9.1 0 1 1 12 20.2zm5-6.8c-.3-.1-1.6-.8-1.8-.9s-.4-.1-.6.1-.7.9-.8 1-.3.2-.6.1a7.4 7.4 0 0 1-2.2-1.4 8.2 8.2 0 0 1-1.5-1.9c-.2-.3 0-.4.1-.6l.4-.5.2-.3a.5.5 0 0 0 0-.5c0-.1-.6-1.4-.8-1.9s-.4-.4-.6-.4h-.5a1 1 0 0 0-.7.3 3 3 0 0 0-.9 2.2 5.2 5.2 0 0 0 1.1 2.8 11.9 11.9 0 0 0 4.6 4.1c1.6.6 2.2.7 3 .6a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 1.7-1.2 2 2 0 0 0 .1-1.2c-.1-.1-.3-.2-.6-.3z" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="zap-texto">
      <h2 id="zap-titulo">Acompanhe a curadoria no WhatsApp</h2>
      <p>Entre no grupo do Cupons.blog para ver os cupons e as ofertas que conferimos.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href={SITE.whatsappGrupo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Entrar no grupo de WhatsApp
    </a>
  </aside>
  <aside class="zap zap-ig" aria-labelledby="ig-titulo">
    <div class="zap-icone" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
        <path fill-rule="evenodd" d="M12 2.16c3.2 0 3.58.01 4.85.07 3.25.15 4.77 1.69 4.92 4.92.06 1.27.07 1.65.07 4.85s-.01 3.58-.07 4.85c-.15 3.23-1.66 4.77-4.92 4.92-1.27.06-1.64.07-4.85.07s-3.58-.01-4.85-.07c-3.26-.15-4.77-1.7-4.92-4.92C2.17 15.58 2.16 15.2 2.16 12s.01-3.58.07-4.85c.15-3.23 1.66-4.77 4.92-4.92C8.42 2.17 8.8 2.16 12 2.16zM12 0C8.74 0 8.33.01 7.05.07 2.7.27.27 2.69.07 7.05.01 8.33 0 8.74 0 12s.01 3.67.07 4.95c.2 4.36 2.62 6.78 6.98 6.98C8.33 23.99 8.74 24 12 24s3.67-.01 4.95-.07c4.35-.2 6.78-2.62 6.98-6.98.06-1.28.07-1.69.07-4.95s-.01-3.67-.07-4.95C23.73 2.7 21.31.27 16.95.07 15.67.01 15.26 0 12 0zm0 5.84a6.16 6.16 0 1 0 0 12.32 6.16 6.16 0 0 0 0-12.32zM12 16a4 4 0 1 1 0-8 4 4 0 0 1 0 8zm6.41-11.85a1.44 1.44 0 1 0 0 2.88 1.44 1.44 0 0 0 0-2.88z" />
      </svg>
    </div>
    <div class="zap-texto">
      <h2 id="ig-titulo">Acompanhe a curadoria no Instagram</h2>
      <p>Siga @achadinhos.cupons.blog para ver os cupons e as ofertas que conferimos.</p>
    </div>
    <a class="btn" href={SITE.instagram} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
      Seguir no Instagram
    </a>
  </aside>
</div>
